e': 'dry'})\n# MANUAL: use (container: 15 ml plastic tubes, other: {})\n\n### AUTOMATED SECTION ###\ndissolve(reagent='DNA in TE', volume='4 ml')\n\n### MANUAL SECTION ###\n# MANUAL: estimate (reagent: DNA, other: {'method': 'spectrophotometer or gel'})\n\n### AUTOMATED SECTION ###\noverlay(reagent='aqueous layer with 95% ethanol', volume='2 volumes')",
